import assets.dl

to get [the website river blink at] {floating-point number:seconds} cycling {floating-point number:duration} offset {floating-point number:offset}:
    set phase to (seconds + offset) / duration
    set phase to phase - (the floor of phase)
    if (phase <= 0.91) or (phase >= 0.95):
        return 0
    if phase < 0.92:
        return ((phase - 0.91) * 25500.0) as an integer
    if phase > 0.94:
        return ((0.95 - phase) * 25500.0) as an integer
    return 255

to [paint website river sprite] {integer:index} in {UI bounds:box} flipped {boolean:flipped} opacity {integer:opacity} on {UI frame:frame}:
    set path to the string form of (the item at index in (the website river artwork))
    set image to UI image from path in (frame's view)
    set sample to UI box at (1.0 if flipped, else 0.0) 0.0 sized (-1.0 if flipped, else 1.0) 1.0
    draw UI texture (image's texture) in box rounded by 0.0 sampling sample in (UI ink 255 255 255) with opacity opacity on frame

to [paint website river blink] {integer:index} across {UI bounds:box} flipped {boolean:flipped} centered {floating-point number:x} {floating-point number:y} radius {floating-point number:rx} {floating-point number:ry} solid {floating-point number:solid} opacity {integer:opacity} on {UI frame:frame}:
    if opacity = 0:
        return nothing
    set image to UI image from (the string form of (the item at index in (the website river artwork))) in (frame's view)
    set sample to UI box at (1.0 if flipped, else 0.0) 0.0 sized (-1.0 if flipped, else 1.0) 1.0
    set center to 1.0 - x if flipped, else x
    set mask to UI box at (box's x + box's width * (center - rx)) (box's y + box's height * (y - ry)) sized (box's width * rx * 2.0) (box's height * ry * 2.0)
    draw UI texture (image's texture) across box sampling sample masked by mask opaque through solid with opacity opacity on frame
